{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PAGE-NUMBER function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310228","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PAGE-NUMBER-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PAGE-NUMBER-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PAGE-NUMBER function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function__section_N1002D_N1002A_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the page number of the output destination\nas an INTEGER value. If the output stream is not paged, PAGE-NUMBER\nreturns a value of 0.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function__syntax_GC19ZT2699258\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d437142e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function__idGDN2PT2673975\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PAGE-NUMBER <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">stream</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> STREAM-HANDLE <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> ) <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">stream</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The name of an output stream. If you do not name a stream, PAGE-NUMBER\nreturns the page number of the default unnamed output stream.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">STREAM-HANDLE <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The handle to an output stream. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> it is\nnot a valid handle to a stream, the AVM generates a run-time error. </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function__example_GC19ZU2699270\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d437142e170\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure creates a customer report with a page number on each page:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-pgnbr.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function__idGDN2PU2673984\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>OUTPUT TO pagenum.txt PAGED.\n\nFOR EACH Customer NO-LOCK:\n  FORM HEADER &quot;Customer report&quot; AT 30\n    &quot;Page:&quot; AT 60 <strong class=\"ph b\">PAGE-NUMBER</strong> FORMAT &quot;&gt;&gt;9&quot; SKIP(1).\n  DISPLAY Customer.CustNum Customer.Name Customer.Address Customer.City\n    Customer.State Customer.Country.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function__see-also_GC19ZV2699276\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d437142e208\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-STREAM-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-STREAM-statement.html\">DEFINE STREAM statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OUTPUT-TO-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OUTPUT-TO-statement.html\">OUTPUT TO statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PAGE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PAGE-statement.html\">PAGE statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Stream-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Stream-object-handle.html\">Stream object handle</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PAGE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PAGE-statement.html\">PAGE statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PAGE-SIZE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PAGE-SIZE-function.html\">PAGE-SIZE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310228","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PAGE-NUMBER function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PAGE-NUMBER-function.html","type":"Manual"}